part ConstraintSample
sketch profile on XY
  line bottom 0 0 80 0
  line right 80 0 80 40
  line top 80 40 0 40
  line left 0 40 0 0
  constraint horizontal bottom
  constraint horizontal top
  constraint vertical right
  constraint vertical left
  constraint perpendicular bottom right
  dim length bottom 80
end
extrude body from profile depth 10 join
